OL,3,AGerard Depardieu and French author     
OL,4,Ainvestigated over sexual allegations   
OL,6,FWarning: this story contains graphic   
OL,7,Fcontent                                
OL,9,FFrench authorities are investigating   
OL,10,Fdisgraced actor Gerard Depardieu and   
OL,11,Fthe author Michel Houellebecq over     
OL,12,F"allegations of a sexual nature", a    
OL,13,Fsource with knowledge of the           
OL,14,Finvestigation says.                    
OL,16,FThe confirmation comes after reports in
OL,17,FFrench media that the two were accused 
OL,18,Fof being involved in a "gang rape" on  
OL,19,Fthe set of the film Thalasso in 2018 by
OL,20,Fan actress.                            
