OL,3,AGerard Depardieu and French author     
OL,4,Ainvestigated over sexual allegations   
OL,6,FThe source told the BBC that a judicial
OL,7,Finvestigation was launched after a     
OL,8,Fcomplaint was filed in May 2025.       
